senses.gloss:
कौलकेय, अस्, ई, अम्, sprung from a noble family,
of a good family, well-born; (अस्), m. a bastard;
(wrong form for कौलटेय.)

कौलत्थ, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. कुलत्थ), made or
prepared with or consisting of Dolichos Uniflorus;
(अम्), n. a drink prepared with Kulattha.

कौलेय, अस्, ई, अम्, sprung from a noble family;
of the left-hand Śākta sect; [cf. कौल, कौलिक,
कौलीन.]

कौलेयक, अस्, ई, अम्, sprung from a noble
family, of good parentage; pertaining to a family;
(अस्), m. a dog (a domestic animal).
